	<div id="container-cookie">
		<div class="cookie-banner-text">
			This website uses cookies and similar technologies to understand visitor experiences. By using this website, you consent to UNC-Chapel Hill's cookie usage in accordance with their <a href="https://www.unc.edu/about/privacy-statement/" title="" target="_blank">Privacy Notice</a>.
